[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1381.15, "timestamp": "00:23:01", "text": "，我只睡了一會兒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1382.59, "timestamp": "00:23:02", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1383.99, "timestamp": "00:23:03", "text": "嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1386.35, "timestamp": "00:23:06", "text": "我今天有工作和課程。今天是星期五，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1388.55, "timestamp": "00:23:08", "text": "平日。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1390.99, "timestamp": "00:23:10", "text": "是的，如果像上次那樣，在周六清晨進行，我就可以做到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1398.15, "timestamp": "00:23:18", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1401.15, "timestamp": "00:23:21", "text": "上週六也是同樣的情況，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1403.51, "timestamp": "00:23:23", "text": "我想，呃，我那天起得很"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1409.83, "timestamp": "00:23:29", "text": "早，呃，或是星期天什麼的，大概是這樣。我一大早就起來等著"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1410.99, "timestamp": "00:23:30", "text": "玩《"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1414.15, "timestamp": "00:23:34", "text": "看門狗》那會兒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1421.51, "timestamp": "00:23:41", "text": "可以請"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1424.43, "timestamp": "00:23:44", "text": "幾天假什麼的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1428.07, "timestamp": "00:23:48", "text": "找個藉口說我生病了。  我星期一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1433.03, "timestamp": "00:23:53", "text": "或哪天可以過來嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1435.79, "timestamp": "00:23:55", "text": "但是，不，呃，但是不不，這週不行。我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1439.23, "timestamp": "00:23:59", "text": "第二份兼職工作，我犯了個錯誤。"}]